<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Thermo Cardio EPS cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Thermo Cardio EPS cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest analyst Marie Conway said she cut her fourth quarter 1996 earnings per share view on Thermo Cardiosystems Inc to a range of $0.05-$0.06 (excluding a nonrecurring charge of $0.08 per share) from $0.10-$0.11.</p>
<p>-- She said she lowered her 1997 EPS view to $0.49 from $0.73.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1-3/4 at 24-1/2.</p>
</text>
